OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fplenty of clear spells to end the day
OL,7,Fwith light winds. This will allow
OL,8,Fpatchy fog to redevelop overnight, the
OL,9,Ffog locally dense in prone spots. A
OL,10,Fchilly night with areas of rural frost
OL,11,Fpossible.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FAny fog and frost should
OL,14,Fgradually clear again on Monday
OL,15,Fmorning with autumnal sunshine
OL,16,Fdeveloping through the morning. Light
OL,17,Fand variable winds gradually turning
OL,18,Feasterly through the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
