OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FCloudier Tuesday but generally dry
OL,7,Fwith rain arriving in the south later,
OL,8,Faccompanied by a southeasterly breeze.
OL,9,FDry for all Wednesday and Thursday
OL,10,Fwith variable cloud. Easterly winds
OL,11,Fthroughout.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
